  "body": "And not even for your own events :(\r\n\r\nI ran a script to peacefully decommission a homeserver by having it leave all rooms, and shortly after the events went out I was being hammered with GET /event requests for the rooms I just left. Surely I shouldn't be receiving these requests anymore given there's no guarantee that the homeserver even knows about the room anymore?",
